[b][size=4][u]INSTALLATION:[/u][/size][/b]
[list]
[*][size=3]Download the extension zip from the Files tab of this page.[/size][/*]
[*][size=3]Drag and drop the zip into the drop box in the bottom-right corner of the Vortex "Extensions" tab. [b][color=#ea9999]DO NOT UNPACK THE ZIP ARCHIVE[/color][/b]. Drop the zip file in directly. Restart Vortex if it asks you to. You may delete the zip once it is installed.[/size][/*]
[*][size=3]Add Sifu in the Vortex "Games" tab. You can use the search box. Do not use the Games tab to download the extension: that gets the old extension without the features listed above.[/size][/*]
[*][size=3]Have fun modding the game![/size][/*]
[/list]

